{
  "_comment": [
    "Every programme of study on the platform. A track can be a topic, a",
    "certificate, or both - LFCS, CKA and AWS are all three of those cases at",
    "once, which is why is_topic and is_certificate are separate flags rather",
    "than one type field.",
    "",
    "Only `cka` carries content today; the rest are created empty so they can be",
    "filled in from the admin panel. An empty track is safe: the collisions this",
    "schema guards against (a repeated phase slug, a repeated week number) can",
    "only happen once a track has phases and weeks.",
    "",
    "exam_minutes and exam_code are null on a topic-only track - there is no",
    "exam, and the UI must not render an exam panel for one."
  ],
